<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!--
  The sprites of RVP Default: for each atlas, what each sprite is and how it
  is drawn. crates/look/src/sprites.rs draws the kinds:

    bar      a vertical gradient (top, bottom) with optional one-pixel
             lines at the top (line) and the bottom (shade)
    fill     a solid colour with optional edge lines (left, right, top,
             bottom)
    cover    rows offset .. offset + height of a bar `total` high, with an
             optional rounded outline (outline, radius) inside
    panel    a rounded rectangle (fill, border, radius), optionally with a
             header strip (header, header-top, header-bottom)
    swatch   one pixel of a colour, for ColorX/ColorY attributes
    button   four states side by side (normal, hover, pressed or on,
             disabled) in a style: round, play, flat, close, tool, toggle,
             field, grip, tab or logo; with an icon (icons.svg) or a
             caption (font.svg)
    track    a rounded bar `thickness` thick for slider backs and fills,
             along the width or (vertical="1") the height
    thumb    a slider thumb: circle or pill
    digits   22 cells with the characters % to : (PotPlayer's PicLabel
             font)
    cells    one caption per cell (an image strip or a MappingDB font)
    caption  one line of text; its width follows the text
    labels   captions centred on given x positions
    icon     an icon without states
    logo     RVP's wordmark

  Colours are #rrggbb or the names defined below. Sizes are pixels; icon
  sizes are the icon's side, caption sizes the cap height.
-->
